// The rep screen (spec, "The core training loop"): the prompt, the answer box, the confidence choice, the buttons, and under them the outcome. The buttons and boxes are widgets drawn last (gym_paint_widgets); this draws what is behind and around them.

// Draw the rep screen's cards and captions for the state.
gym_paint_repetition(Session gym_state) {
  gym_paint_question(gym_state);
  gym_paint_captions();
  gym_paint_outcome(gym_state);
} return void;
